#N canvas 40 40 760 520 12;
#X text 20 5 [eq3] - 3-band boost / cut EQ. inlet 0 signal \, inlets 1-3: low \, mid \, high in dB (-24 to +6 \, 0 = flat \, the default). bands split at 250 Hz and 2500 Hz with xover-lr4. the low band also runs through a 2500 Hz crossover summed back \, which matches its phase to the other two so all bands at 0 dB measure flat;
#X obj 20 60 inlet~;
#X obj 300 60 inlet;
#X obj 450 60 inlet;
#X obj 600 60 inlet;
#X obj 20 110 xover-lr4;
#X obj 20 160 xover-lr4;
#X obj 160 160 xover-lr4;
#X obj 20 200 +~;
#X obj 20 250 *~;
#X obj 160 250 *~;
#X obj 300 250 *~;
#X obj 20 300 +~;
#X obj 20 330 +~;
#X obj 20 370 outlet~;
#X obj 600 110 loadbang;
#X msg 600 140 250;
#X msg 660 140 2500;
#X msg 720 140 0;
#X obj 300 190 clip -24 6;
#X obj 300 220 + 100;
#X obj 300 250 dbtorms;
#X obj 300 280 pack f 20;
#X obj 300 310 line~;
